{"seq":1,"slug":"convolution-operations","title":"卷积操作原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/convolutional-networks/convolution-operations","wordCount":1229,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"卷积操作原理\">卷积操作原理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>卷积操作是卷积神经网络的基础构件，通过滑动卷积核在输入特征图上提取局部模式。与全连接层不同，卷积层利用参数共享和局部连接两大特性，在大幅减少参数量的同时保留了空间结构信息。这种设计使得 CNN 能够高效学习图像中的边缘、纹理、形状等层次化特征。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;输入特征图&lt;br/&gt;H×W×C&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;卷积核&lt;br/&gt;K×K×C&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;滑动窗口&lt;br/&gt;逐位置计算&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;输出特征图&lt;br/&gt;H&#39;×W&#39;×F&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;激活函数&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;下一层输入&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"输入特征图&lt;br/&gt;H×W×C\"] --&gt; B[\"卷积核&lt;br/&gt;K×K×C\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"滑动窗口&lt;br/&gt;逐位置计算\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"输出特征图&lt;br/&gt;H'×W'×F\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"激活函数\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"下一层输入\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>参数量</th>\n<th>计算量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准卷积</td>\n<td>K×K×C_in 核，F 个</td>\n<td>K²×C_in×F</td>\n<td>K²×C_in×F×H&#39;×W&#39;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度可分离卷积</td>\n<td>逐通道 + 逐点</td>\n<td>K²×C_in + C_in×F</td>\n<td>K²×C_in×H&#39;×W&#39; + C_in×F×H&#39;×W&#39;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空洞卷积</td>\n<td>膨胀感受野</td>\n<td>K²×C_in×F</td>\n<td>同标准卷积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转置卷积</td>\n<td>上采样</td>\n<td>K²×C_in×F</td>\n<td>同标准卷积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分组卷积</td>\n<td>通道分组计算</td>\n<td>K²×C_in×F/G</td>\n<td>标准卷积的 1/G</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"互相关与卷积\">互相关与卷积</h2><p>严格来说，深度学习中的&quot;卷积&quot;操作实际上是互相关（cross-correlation）运算——卷积核直接在输入上滑动并逐元素相乘求和，而不做数学卷积中的核翻转。由于卷积核的参数是通过学习得到的，翻转与否不影响网络的表达能力，因此框架中统一使用互相关并称之为卷积。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def conv2d_naive(input_map, kernel, stride=1, padding=0):&#10;    if padding &gt; 0:&#10;        input_map = np.pad(input_map, ((padding, padding), (padding, padding)), mode=&#39;constant&#39;)&#10;    h_in, w_in = input_map.shape&#10;    k_h, k_w = kernel.shape&#10;    h_out = (h_in - k_h) // stride + 1&#10;    w_out = (w_in - k_w) // stride + 1&#10;    output = np.zeros((h_out, w_out))&#10;    for i in range(h_out):&#10;        for j in range(w_out):&#10;            region = input_map[i*stride:i*stride+k_h, j*stride:j*stride+k_w]&#10;            output[i, j] = np.sum(region * kernel)&#10;    return output\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> conv2d_naive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input_map, kernel, stride</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> padding </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        input_map </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.pad(input_map, ((padding, padding), (padding, padding)), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'constant'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    h_in, w_in </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> input_map.shape</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    k_h, k_w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kernel.shape</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    h_out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (h_in </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k_h) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stride </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    w_out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (w_in </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k_w) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stride </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    output </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.zeros((h_out, w_out))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(h_out):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w_out):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            region </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> input_map[i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stride:i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stride</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">k_h, j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stride:j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stride</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">k_w]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            output[i, j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sum(region </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kernel)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> output</span></span></code></pre></div><p>步幅（stride）控制卷积核的滑动步长，步幅为 2 意味着输出特征图的空间尺寸减半。填充（padding）在输入边缘补零以控制输出尺寸。&quot;same&quot; 填充使输出与输入尺寸相同，&quot;valid&quot; 填充不补零。输出尺寸公式为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><mi>S</mi></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{out} = \\lfloor\\frac{H_{in} + 2P - K}{S}\\rfloor + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"感受野与多尺度特征\">感受野与多尺度特征</h2><p>感受野（receptive field）指输出特征图上一个元素对应的输入区域大小。随着网络层数加深，每层的感受野逐层扩大。第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 层的感受野大小为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RF_l = RF_{l-1} + (K_l - 1) \\times \\prod_{i=1}^{l-1} S_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 感受野逐层扩大&#10;        A[&quot;Conv1: 3×3&lt;br/&gt;RF = 3×3&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Conv2: 3×3&lt;br/&gt;RF = 5×5&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; C[&quot;Conv3: 3×3&lt;br/&gt;RF = 7×7&quot;]&#10;        C --&gt; D[&quot;Conv4: 3×3&lt;br/&gt;RF = 9×9&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 感受野逐层扩大\n        A[\"Conv1: 3×3&lt;br/&gt;RF = 3×3\"] --&gt; B[\"Conv2: 3×3&lt;br/&gt;RF = 5×5\"]\n        B --&gt; C[\"Conv3: 3×3&lt;br/&gt;RF = 7×7\"]\n        C --&gt; D[\"Conv4: 3×3&lt;br/&gt;RF = 9×9\"]\n    end</pre><p>两层 3×3 卷积的感受野等价于一层 5×5 卷积，三层 3×3 等价于一层 7×7。但多层小卷积核在参数量和计算量上都更优，同时引入了更多的非线性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>感受野</th>\n<th>参数量</th>\n<th>非线性次数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 层 7×7</td>\n<td>7×7</td>\n<td>49C²</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 层 3×3</td>\n<td>7×7</td>\n<td>27C²</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 层 5×5</td>\n<td>5×5</td>\n<td>25C²</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 层 3×3</td>\n<td>5×5</td>\n<td>18C²</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这就是 VGGNet 提出的核心设计原则：用多层小卷积核替代少层大卷积核，在相同感受野下获得更强的特征提取能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"深度可分离卷积\">深度可分离卷积</h2><p>深度可分离卷积（Depthwise Separable Convolution）将标准卷积分解为两步：逐通道卷积（depthwise）和逐点卷积（pointwise），大幅减少参数量和计算量。</p>\n<p>逐通道卷积对每个输入通道独立应用一个 K×K 的卷积核，不做跨通道的信息融合。逐点卷积使用 1×1 卷积核做跨通道的线性组合。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class DepthwiseSeparableConv(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size, stride=1, padding=0):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.depthwise = nn.Conv2d(&#10;            in_channels, in_channels, kernel_size,&#10;            stride=stride, padding=padding, groups=in_channels&#10;        )&#10;        self.pointwise = nn.Conv2d(in_channels, out_channels, 1)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        x = self.depthwise(x)&#10;        x = self.pointwise(x)&#10;        return x\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DepthwiseSeparableConv</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size, stride</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.depthwise </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Conv2d(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            in_channels, in_channels, kernel_size,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            stride</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stride, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">padding, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">in_channels</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pointwise </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Conv2d(in_channels, out_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.depthwise(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pointwise(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x</span></span></code></pre></div><p>以 3×3 卷积、输入 64 通道、输出 128 通道为例，标准卷积参数量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>128</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>73</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>728</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 3 \\times 64 \\times 128 = 73,728</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">73</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">728</span></span></span></span></span>，深度可分离卷积参数量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>128</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>768</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 3 \\times 64 + 64 \\times 128 = 8,768</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">768</span></span></span></span></span>，仅为标准卷积的约 12%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"空洞卷积与转置卷积\">空洞卷积与转置卷积</h2><p><strong>空洞卷积</strong>（Dilated/Atrous Convolution）在卷积核元素之间插入空洞，在不增加参数量的情况下扩大感受野。膨胀率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 决定了空洞的大小，膨胀率为 2 的 3×3 卷积核实际覆盖 5×5 的区域。</p>\n<p>空洞卷积在语义分割中广泛使用，DeepLab 系列通过不同膨胀率的空洞卷积组成 ASPP（Atrous Spatial Pyramid Pooling）模块，捕捉多尺度上下文信息。</p>\n<p><strong>转置卷积</strong>（Transposed Convolution）用于上采样，将低分辨率特征图恢复到高分辨率。它并非卷积的数学逆运算，而是通过在输入元素之间插入零值后执行标准卷积来实现尺寸扩大。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"up = nn.ConvTranspose2d(128, 64, kernel_size=4, stride=2, padding=1)&#10;down = nn.Conv2d(64, 128, kernel_size=3, stride=2, padding=1)&#10;&#10;x = torch.randn(1, 64, 32, 32)&#10;y = down(x)&#10;z = up(y)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">up </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.ConvTranspose2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kernel_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">stride</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">down </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Conv2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kernel_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">stride</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> down(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> up(y)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>转置卷积容易产生&quot;棋盘格效应&quot;（checkerboard artifacts），因为相邻输出像素可能被不同数量的核元素覆盖。在生成模型中，通常用双线性上采样 + 标准卷积替代转置卷积以避免伪影。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((卷积操作))&#10;    基础运算&#10;      互相关计算&#10;      步幅与填充&#10;      输出尺寸公式&#10;    感受野&#10;      逐层扩大&#10;      小核堆叠优于大核&#10;    高效变体&#10;      深度可分离卷积&#10;      分组卷积&#10;    特殊卷积&#10;      空洞卷积&#10;      转置卷积\">mindmap\n  root((卷积操作))\n    基础运算\n      互相关计算\n      步幅与填充\n      输出尺寸公式\n    感受野\n      逐层扩大\n      小核堆叠优于大核\n    高效变体\n      深度可分离卷积\n      分组卷积\n    特殊卷积\n      空洞卷积\n      转置卷积</pre><ul>\n<li>卷积通过参数共享和局部连接高效提取空间特征</li>\n<li>深度学习中的卷积实际上是互相关运算，但不影响学习效果</li>\n<li>多层小卷积核在感受野、参数量和非线性上都优于少层大卷积核</li>\n<li>深度可分离卷积将参数量和计算量降低约 8-9 倍，是轻量级网络的核心组件</li>\n<li>空洞卷积通过膨胀率在不增加参数的情况下扩大感受野</li>\n<li>转置卷积用于上采样但容易产生棋盘格效应，工程中常用上采样 + 卷积替代</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"卷积操作原理","id":"卷积操作原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"互相关与卷积","id":"互相关与卷积"},{"level":2,"text":"感受野与多尺度特征","id":"感受野与多尺度特征"},{"level":2,"text":"深度可分离卷积","id":"深度可分离卷积"},{"level":2,"text":"空洞卷积与转置卷积","id":"空洞卷积与转置卷积"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"批归一化与归一化技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/neural-network-foundations/batch-normalization"},"next":{"title":"经典 CNN 架构演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/convolutional-networks/classic-architectures"}}